---
// The payoff that closes a section (M 2026-11-23: "after each section a
// feeling I got sth from it"): what the reader can now do or see, in one
// line. No points, no badges, no progress: a plain statement of the gain.
---

<p class="vx-takeaway"><span class="vx-takeaway-tag">You can now</span> <span><slot /></span></p>

<style>
  .vx-takeaway {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    align-items: baseline;
    margin: 1.25rem 0 2rem;
    padding: 0.55rem 0.9rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: var(--vx-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--vx-border);
    color: var(--vx-fg);
  }
  .vx-takeaway-tag {
    flex: none;
    font-family: var(--vx-mono);
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--vx-ok);
  }
</style>
